    "updated_at": "2021-09-06T20:41:44Z",
    "body": "Support for `application/unknown` and `unknown/unknown` were [reported to be](https://www.adambarth.com/papers/2009/barth-caballero-song.pdf) exclusive to Chrome as of May 2009. (Internet Explorer 7, Firefox 3, and Safari 3.1 did not support them.)",
